  "label": "Puppet Master Imagery as Antisemitic Tropes",
  "description": "The term 'puppet master' is an antisemitic trope that implies Jewish people control global events or media. While not explicitly stated, the use of a puppet (Ernie) in the meme may be a subtle reference to this trope, suggesting that the 'minority' being locked in the oven is being manipulated or controlled — a dangerous and dehumanizing stereotype.",
